<details class="wp-block-details" style="border-bottom-color:#E5DDD0;border-bottom-width:1px;padding-top:20px;padding-bottom:20px" open><summary>How is the throw sized?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"fontFamily":"Figtree, sans-serif","fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.55"},"color":{"text":"#2A2722"},"spacing":{"margin":{"top":"20px","bottom":"0px"}}}} -->
<p class="has-text-color" style="color:#2A2722;margin-top:20px;margin-bottom:0px;font-family:Figtree, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55">The Throw (50 × 65") covers one person on a couch with room to spare. The Bed size drapes over a queen. The Lap size lives in a reading chair.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details {"style":{"border":{"bottom":{"color":"#E5DDD0","width":"1px"}},"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"20px","bottom":"20px"}}}} -->
<details class="wp-block-details" style="border-bottom-color:#E5DDD0;border-bottom-width:1px;padding-top:20px;padding-bottom:20px"><summary>Will it shed?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"fontFamily":"Figtree, sans-serif","fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.55"},"color":{"text":"#2A2722"},"spacing":{"margin":{"top":"20px","bottom":"0"}}}} -->
<p class="has-text-color" style="color:#2A2722;margin-top:20px;margin-bottom:0;font-family:Figtree, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55">There\'s a small shed in the first week or two as the loose fibers settle out. After that it stays put for the long haul.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details {"style":{"border":{"bottom":{"color":"#E5DDD0","width":"1px"}},"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"20px","bottom":"20px"}}}} -->
<details class="wp-block-details" style="border-bottom-color:#E5DDD0;border-bottom-width:1px;padding-top:20px;padding-bottom:20px"><summary>Do you restock sold-out colors?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"fontFamily":"Figtree, sans-serif","fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.55"},"color":{"text":"#2A2722"},"spacing":{"margin":{"top":"20px","bottom":"0"}}}} -->
<p class="has-text-color" style="color:#2A2722;margin-top:20px;margin-bottom:0;font-family:Figtree, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55">Sometimes. Stone and Moss are core; Clay and Ink are seasonal and may not return in the same dye lot.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details {"style":{"border":{"bottom":{"color":"#E5DDD0","width":"1px"}},"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"20px","bottom":"20px"}}}} -->
<details class="wp-block-details" style="border-bottom-color:#E5DDD0;border-bottom-width:1px;padding-top:20px;padding-bottom:20px"><summary>What\'s the return policy?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"fontFamily":"Figtree, sans-serif","fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.55"},"color":{"text":"#2A2722"},"spacing":{"margin":{"top":"20px","bottom":"0","left":"0","right":"0"}}}} -->
<p class="has-text-color" style="color:#2A2722;margin-top:20px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;font-family:Figtree, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55">30 days, no questions, prepaid label. If you\'ve used it, that\'s fine — we\'d rather know it didn\'t fit your home.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
